<Slide>
  <Box style={{width: '100%', height: '100%', paddingTop: 32, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64}}>
    {/* A · Title block */}
    <Box style={{height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12}}>
      <Box style={{width: 4, height: 40, background: '#0072BC', marginTop: 4}} />
      <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
        <Text style={{fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D', lineHeight: 1.3}}>目录</Text>
        <Text style={{fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6}}>
          我们做了什么、为什么做、以及它给你的运维带来什么改变。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B · Content */}
    <Box style={{height: 516, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40}}>
      {/* Left rail */}
      <Box style={{width: 300, height: '100%'}}>
        <Box style={{background: '#0F2C4D', borderRadius: 10, padding: 28, height: '100%', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0072BC', letterSpacing: '1.5px'}}>议程</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 700, color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.3}}>
              五章内容，<br />讲同一件事
            </Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.6}}>
            你的网络本来就在产生数据。缺的是一个地方：数据按时到达、说得出依据、
            并且直接送到该行动的人手上。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      {/* Right list */}
      <Box style={{flex: 1, height: '100%', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24, paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#0072BC', width: 44}}>01</Text>
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>运维现状</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 3}}>
              一天的工作真正断在哪里：源头分散、看板两处、报表靠手工拼。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24, paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#0072BC', width: 44}}>02</Text>
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>一个平台，一条流水线</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 3}}>
              从七类上游系统到一个对外发布的数字，中间没有任何一步需要人。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24, paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#0072BC', width: 44}}>03</Text>
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>统一运维门户</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 3}}>
              所有看板、质量指标和报表都在一个登录之后，电脑和手机都能看。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24, paddingBottom: 18, borderBottom: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#0072BC', width: 44}}>04</Text>
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>数据洞察平台</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 3}}>
              数字背后的引擎：定时采集、逐层下钻、任务失败自愈。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#0072BC', width: 44}}>05</Text>
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>智能助手与价值</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 3}}>
              值班群里直接问到答案，以及这套平台带来的四项转变。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C · Footer */}
    <Box style={{height: 40, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>OLR MS 运维工具平台</Text>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>02 / 17</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
